<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92836" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυπ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for cleansing from dirt</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυπτικωτάτη κόνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.697a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὴ δύναμις</span>
			<i>detergent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.565
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. τοῦ φάρυγγος</span>
			<i>cleansing</i> or <i>clearing</i> the throat, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				903b29
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				65d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.1.3
			</span></i>: but c. gen. objecti, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ξηρότητος</span>
			<i>fit for cleaning</i> it <i>off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				443a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purgative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				873b1
			</span></i>.</div>
